00:13:03.820 --> 00:13:07.480
group they learn about that thing in a
quick way once a week. That's their

00:13:07.480 --> 00:13:11.320
community of practice but the point to
your question then is that's a flexible

00:13:11.320 --> 00:13:13.900
domain right. People are going to leave
and move on and do other jobs, new people

00:13:13.900 --> 00:13:18.190
are going to join the organization, it's
totally fine that those new hires then

00:13:18.190 --> 00:13:21.220
come and integrate into that community
of practice. You know it should be

00:13:21.220 --> 00:13:25.030
visible enough that people know where
the front door is and then welcoming

00:13:25.030 --> 00:13:28.000
enough that if you have a you know a
reason to be there and something that

00:13:28.000 --> 00:13:30.580
you want to contribute that you're able
to come in and integrate with those

00:13:30.580 --> 00:13:32.850
activities.

