separate or is it useful to actually
integrate more strongly or have a sub

00:16:37.809 --> 00:16:41.259
working group? Yeah and I think I think
those are completely valid questions and

00:16:41.259 --> 00:16:45.069
I would say that NABI is not the only
organization that is thinking about

00:16:45.069 --> 00:16:47.769
communities of practice in this space
right. There are there are multiple ones

00:16:47.769 --> 00:16:54.399
AAAS convenes one as well. I think
part of this is being quite realistic

00:16:54.399 --> 00:16:58.540
about what it is that we as individuals
want to achieve right, that we we are all

00:16:58.540 --> 00:17:03.279
very busy people, we cannot be fully
present in multiple different places at

00:17:03.279 --> 00:17:07.269
the same time. So it's really about
finding finding your tribe, finding your

00:17:07.269 --> 00:17:11.980
people to do the thing that you want to
work on and I personally don't

00:17:11.980 --> 00:17:16.000
necessarily think that it matters who
the convening organization is and I

00:17:16.000 --> 00:17:19.029
don't necessarily think those convening organizations have to be in competition

00:17:19.029 --> 00:17:22.630
with each other and I'm sure they
wouldn't describe themselves as such. So

00:17:22.630 --> 00:17:26.559
I think they can be interrelated but we
should also be realistic about not

00:17:26.559 --> 00:17:32.830
expecting people to be as engaged in
every location although have visibility

00:17:32.830 --> 00:17:37.440
on what is going on in the different
spaces.

